#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0701 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Within a given value of PARAMCD for a combination of device and subject, PCHG is populated and is not equal to ((AVAL - BASE)/BASE)*100
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure="MEDICAL DEVICE BASIC DATA STRUCTURE"
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col BASE type=Num
col PCHG type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | GLUC | 10 | 5 | 100
---
